        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    title OrganizerLogin [Authentication Flow]\n\n    actor Organizer as Organizer&lt;br/&gt;(human user)\n    participant FE as AngularFrontend\n    participant API as AdonisJSAPI\n    participant DB as MySQLDatabase\n\n    Organizer -&gt;&gt; FE: enters submit email + password&lt;br/&gt;(login form)\n    activate FE\n\n    FE -&gt;&gt; API: POST /api/login&lt;br/&gt;{ email, password }\n    activate API\n\n    API -&gt;&gt; DB: SELECT * FROM organizers&lt;br/&gt;WHERE email = ?\n    activate DB\n    DB --&gt;&gt; API: organizer row OR NULL\n    deactivate DB\n\n    API -&gt;&gt; API: bcrypt.compare(plain, password_hash)\n\n    alt valid credentials\n        API -&gt;&gt; API: generate JWT&lt;br/&gt;(sign with JWT_SECRET,&lt;br/&gt;payload: { id, email, role })\n        API --&gt;&gt; FE: 200 OK&lt;br/&gt;{ token, organizer }\n        FE -&gt;&gt; FE: persist token in localStorage\n        FE --&gt;&gt; Organizer: redirect to dashboard\n        Note over FE,API: token travels in&lt;br/&gt;Authorization: Bearer *** header&lt;br/&gt;on every subsequent request\n    else invalid credentials&lt;br/&gt;OR user not found\n        API --&gt;&gt; FE: 401 Unauthorized&lt;br/&gt;{ error: \&quot;Invalid credentials\&quot; }\n        FE --&gt;&gt; Organizer: show error message&lt;br/&gt;(testCase: Verify Login Error Message)\n    end\n\n    deactivate API\n    deactivate FE&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KVdbRZ0hJwUzb-66g9tt-1">
